{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"ObsoleteFeatures\">Obsolete Features</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"ObsoleteFeatures On Settings To ToDate\">The <em>Obsolete Features</em> section, found under the <strong>Settings</strong> tab, allows you to enable features that are no longer recommended for use.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Is On\">These features are maintained for compatibility with existing data but should not be used in new implementations.</p><div class=\"flex pointer-events-none space-x-6 rtl:space-x-reverse items-center\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block ltr:pr-8 rtl:pl-8\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 ltr:pl-8 rtl:pr-8\"><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"border-y ltr:border-l rtl:border-r border-neutral-300 bg-white p-4 flex gap-2 items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-cog text-neutral-400\"></i><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Settings\">Settings</span></span></div><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div></div></div><span class=\"rtl:hidden\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-chevron-right text-lg text-neutral-300\"></i></span><span class=\"ltr:hidden\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-chevron-left text-lg text-neutral-300\"></i></span><div class=\"border rounded inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"basis-72 flex items-center gap-2 p-4\"><i class=\"text-xl text-neutral-400 fas fa-fw fa-scroll-old\"></i><span class=\"text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"ObsoleteFeatures\">Obsolete Features</span></span></div></div></div><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"ClassicCustomFields Custom CustomField CustomFields To ToDate\">Classic Custom Fields</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"ClassicCustomFields Current Custom CustomField CustomFields NewCustomField Rent To ToDate\">If you are currently using <em>Classic Custom Fields</em>, we recommend migrating to the new custom fields system.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And On Other\">The new system provides improved flexibility and better integration with other features.</p><p><span translate=\"true\" keywords=\"ClassicCustomFields Custom CustomField CustomFields LearnMore To ToDate\">Learn more about classic custom fields:</span> <a href=\"/guides/classic-custom-fields\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"ClassicCustomFields\">Classic Custom Fields</span></a></p>",
  "key": "obsolete-features"
}
